+        "## Proposed changes (ordered, validatable)\n\n"
+        "1. E-01: Update `src/feature.py`.\n\n"
+        "## Deferred / out of scope (with reason)\n\n"
+        "- None.\n\n"
+        "## Scope check\n\n"
+        "- Over-scope: none.\n"
+        "- Under-scope: none.\n\n"
+        "## Required tests / validation\n\n"
+        "- Verify `src/feature.py` returns the updated greeting (V-01).\n\n"
+        "## Spec / documentation sync\n\n"
+        "No spec change needed.\n\n"
+        "## Open questions\n\n"
+        "None open.\n\n"
+        "## Validation and cross-check (verify before reporting done)\n\n"
+        f"- [{v_box}] V-01 validates E-01\n"
+        "  - Required evidence: paste the test output confirming the updated greeting.\n"
+        f"  - Observed evidence: {v_ev}\n"
+        f"  - Result: {v_res}\n\n"
+        "## Approval and execution gate\n\n"
+        "- Size assessment: standard\n"
+        "- Cohesion rationale: not required\n\n"
+        "Execute after human approval.\n"
+    )
